    <item rdf:about="https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/almond_crescent_cookies?rev=1609088535&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2020-12-27T12:02:15-0400</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>Anonymous (anonymous@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>recipes:almond_crescent_cookies</title>
        <link>https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/almond_crescent_cookies?rev=1609088535&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Almond Crescent Cookies (Christmas Cookies)- Rosemary Molloy
(Makes about 40 cookies). 

Ingredients

	*  1 cup butter, softened
	*  3/4 cup sugar
	*  1 pinch salt (if you use unsalted butter, use 1/4 teaspoon salt)
	*  3/4 cup finely chopped fresh almonds(or walnuts or pecans)</description>
    </item>
    <item rdf:about="https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/beefy_mushroom_barley_soup?rev=1607802014&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2020-12-12T14:40:14-0400</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>Anonymous (anonymous@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>recipes:beefy_mushroom_barley_soup</title>
        <link>https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/beefy_mushroom_barley_soup?rev=1607802014&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Beefy Mushroom Barley Soup
from: Penzey's Spices

Ingredients:

	*  1 lb lean beef chuck (beef stew meat), cut into 1 inch cubes
	*  2 tablespoons olive oil
	*  3 medium or 2 large onions, coarsely chopped
	*  10 oz fresh mushrooms, sliced
	*  3 large carrots, sliced</description>
    </item>
    <item rdf:about="https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/beet_salad_with_feta?rev=1607803448&amp;do=diff">
