        <link>https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/beet_salad_with_feta?rev=1607803448&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Beet salad with Feta, from William Sonoma's “Mediterranean Cooking”,1997; recipes by Joyce Goldstein.

Ingredients:

	*  4 large or 8 small beets
	*  1/2 cup extra-virgin olive oil
	*  3 tablespoons red wine vinegar (or 1.4 cup fresh lemon juice)</description>
    </item>
