        <description>Black Beans and Rice
 from “A Taste of Old Cuba”, by Maria Josefa LLuria de O'Higgins.

8 Servings

Ingredients: 
1. For cooking the beans:

	*  1 pound dry black beans
	*  2.5 quarts water
	*  1 green bell pepper, cored, seeded and cut into strips</description>
    </item>
    <item rdf:about="https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/broccoli_with_asian_garlic_sauce?rev=1521305396&amp;do=diff">
