        <description>Tossed Greens and Grapes Salad

	*  3/4 cup olive oil
	*  1/4 cup red wine vinegar
	*  1 1/2 tablespoon Dijon mustard
	*  1 1/2 teaspoon honey
	*  1/8 teaspoon salt
	*  1/8 teaspoon pepper
	*  1 (5 ounce) package Spring greens or baby greens
	*  2 cups seedless red grapes, halved and rinsed well</description>
    </item>
