    <item rdf:about="https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/wilted_spinach_salad?rev=1595172366&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2020-07-19T11:26:06-0400</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>Anonymous (anonymous@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>recipes:wilted_spinach_salad</title>
        <link>https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/wilted_spinach_salad?rev=1595172366&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Wilted spinach salad

This salad has been on the menu since the restaurant opened and is still a
favourite we make every day. The spinach is tossed with very hot olive oil, which
cooks it slightly, sweetening and softening the leaves. As the feta cheese and the
olives are both salty, no additional salt is needed.</description>
    </item>
